'''Empress' Research''' is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]-centered "questline" involving numerous stages and [[Catnip Challenges|missions]], first introduced in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]]. It is a key part of progression because of how many features are gated behind it, most importantly [[Imminent Disaster]] and [[The Aku Realms]].

==Part 1: Empress' Research==
The first part consists of two tiers of three groups of maps that appear during a specific hour of each day.

The first tier is unlocked after completing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3; each map contains four stages and disappears when you clear a stage, so it will take a minimum of 4 days to finish Tier 1. [[Aku Doge]] appears commonly throughout these maps along with two new [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] peons: [[Cerberus Kids]] and [[Aku Gory]].

The second tier consists of the "Wicked Cat" maps, which will pit you against Aku versions of the first three [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]]. Each appears after clearing a specific Tier 1 map and shares a schedule with the one that was required to unlock it. Unlike the first tier, these don't disappear and only contain two stages per map. Players can only clear each Tier 1 and Tier 2 map once per save file.

Each group awards 50 [[Cat Food]] via [[Catnip Challenges]]. Complete all three groups to receive an additional 50 Cat Food and move onto Part 2.

