==Part 3B: Empress' Excavation==
Empress' Excavation's rewards and mechanics are similar to the Empress' Reports, but the last prize of each map is an [[:Category:Ancient Eggs|Ancient Egg]] that has a 100% chance to drop. Unlike the other Empress' Research stages, Empress' Excavation focuses around [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] enemies, with a new one introduced in each map. [[Empress' Excavation 1]] also features the seasonal event enemies [[Vlad de Sable]] and [[Le'mammoth]].

